        IF `reg 29(3) the relevant person must act as soon as the beneficiaries of the insurance policy are identified or designated` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Paragraphs (3) to (5) apply if the relevant person is providing a customer with a contract of long-term insurance" (Marginal readings, (a): a failed condition of an "if")
