        IF NOT (`reg 29(3) the relevant person must act as soon as the beneficiaries of the insurance policy are identified or designated` EQUALS JUST TRUE) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "reg 29(3) the relevant person must act as soon as the beneficiaries of the insurance policy are identified or designated" has not been answered
